        "action_date": "2025-02-26",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Defund NPR Act</strong></p><p>This bill prohibits federal funding of National Public Radio (NPR) or any successor organization.&nbsp;The prohibition includes the payment of dues to or the purchase of programming from NPR by a public broadcast station using federal funds. </p>",
